incomplete_agent.set_location(Some("Cafeteria"));
incomplete_agent.set_goal(Some("Grab Coffee"));
```

## Installation

Add the following to your `Cargo.toml`:

```toml
[dependencies]
agent-coordinate = "0.1.0"
